      "widgets_values": [
        "## SheetSage2: audio to ABC score\n\nLoad a song, run, and copy the ABC text.\n\n- **melody** mode: lead melody only\n- **full** mode: melody plus chord symbols\n\nPaste the ABC into an ABC editor (for example abcjs or EasyABC) to view it or export MIDI, or feed it to a YuE 2 workflow as the score.\n\nModel: [sheetsage2_bf16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/YuE2/resolve/main/audio_encoders/sheetsage2_bf16.safetensors) in `models/audio_encoders/`. Licence CC BY-NC 4.0 (non-commercial)."
